{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536660/extras/a8748cb044b7f93ecd01949c0cbb8828.avif?t=1768061852\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">THIS IS NOT A SIMPLE LOOP. IT IS YOUR FINAL JUDGMENT.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Lisa. You are a gambler. But in this 1950s advertising agency, what\u2019s at stake is not chips or banknotes: <strong>it\u2019s your soul.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i></i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536660/extras/159cad9ca918c465a666e452b7101a44.avif?t=1768061852\" width=1200 height=450 /></span><br><i>Cross 10 identical floors. Find the anomaly. Survive the nightmare.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83c\udfb2 THE GOLDEN RULE: ALL OR NOTHING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is simple, the punishment eternal. Observe every detail. Nothing must escape your risk-trained eyes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DOES EVERYTHING SEEM NORMAL?</strong> Enter the <strong>LEFT</strong> elevator.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DO YOU FEEL SOMETHING IS WRONG?</strong> Enter the <strong>RIGHT</strong> elevator.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536660/extras/f1f50e1176cd1cf570c2f457cf66ad42.avif?t=1768061852\" width=1200 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WARNING:</strong> One single mistake, one single distraction, and the loop throws you back to Floor 1. Your sanity is the minimum bet required to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcfd\ufe0f A \u201cTWILIGHT ZONE\u201d ATMOSPHERE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a flawless Noir-Advertising aesthetic. Vibrant neon lights, dense smoke, and an oppressive soundtrack. Every visual detail is a love letter to the <strong>Golden Age of television science fiction</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536660/extras/902c5177ef838c8e90d1a5b42c5bbd56.avif?t=1768061852\" width=1200 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udde0 THE GAME IS WATCHING YOU (AND JUDGING YOU)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way you will find terminals ready to question you. These are not simple quizzes: they are dark mirrors. Your moral answers will shape a <strong>dynamic psychological profile</strong> that reveals who you truly are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536660/extras/24ac9e213586fc667a9a3612d3c40f11.avif?t=1768061852\" width=1200 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udccf LISA\u2019S SECRET</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between floors, you may find doors that should not exist. Reconstruct the past of a woman who gambled everything: her family, her career, her daughter\u2019s life. Will you uncover the truth before the shadows consume you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536660/extras/02d31761a5b039373e038e66671b2a1a.avif?t=1768061852\" width=1200 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHAT AWAITS YOU IN \u201cALL IN\u201d:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolving Anomalies:</strong> Visual, audio, and psychological. Nothing is ever the same.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Narrative:</strong> A horror experience that digs into the drama of addiction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings:</strong> Your playstyle will decide Lisa\u2019s fate.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Authorial Design:</strong> Crafted with the aesthetic vision of a professional designer.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>YOU HAVE LOST EVERYTHING. ARE YOU READY TO PLAY YOUR LAST CHANCE?</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3536660?t=1768061852","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536660/2ff32d669779a86ca69b19ecc2ed144f9ab8a68e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768061852","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536660/f9368bc0b2a65ce22b5fdc689cfe2758599d3abe/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768061852","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536660/f9368bc0b2a65ce22b5fdc689cfe2758599d3abe/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768061852","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains a brief non-sexual scene in which a story character is shown from behind, without clothing, while sitting in a bathtub. No frontal nudity or explicit sexual content is depicted, and the moment is presented purely for narrative and atmospheric purposes.\r\n\r\nThe game also explores several mature and potentially sensitive themes. These include gambling addiction, psychological distress, and mentions of suicide. None of these topics are portrayed in a glorifying or encouraging way. Instead, they are addressed as part of the emotional and narrative arc of the protagonist, who must confront the harmful consequences of compulsive gambling and navigate a difficult path of self-reflection and redemption.\r\n\r\nThese elements are intended to support the story and tone of Scary Shadow Spot: All In, highlighting the darker aspects of the character\u2019s journey while ultimately emphasizing recovery, personal growth, and the struggles involved in breaking free from destructive behaviors."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536660/extras/a8748cb044b7f93ecd01949c0cbb8828.avif?t=1768061852\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">THIS IS NOT A SIMPLE LOOP. IT IS YOUR FINAL JUDGMENT.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Lisa. You are a gambler. But in this 1950s advertising agency, what\u2019s at stake is not chips or banknotes: <strong>it\u2019s your soul.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i></i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536660/extras/159cad9ca918c465a666e452b7101a44.avif?t=1768061852\" width=1200 height=450 /></span><br><i>Cross 10 identical floors. Find the anomaly. Survive the nightmare.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83c\udfb