strong> that reveals who you truly are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536660/extras/24ac9e213586fc667a9a3612d3c40f11.avif?t=1768061852\" width=1200 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udccf LISA\u2019S SECRET</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between floors, you may find doors that should not exist. Reconstruct the past of a woman who gambled everything: her family, her career, her daughter\u2019s life. Will you uncover the truth before the shadows consume you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536660/extras/02d31761a5b039373e038e66671b2a1a.avif?t=1768061852\" width=1200 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHAT AWAITS YOU IN \u201cALL IN\u201d:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolving Anomalies:</strong> Visual, audio, and psychological. Nothing is ever the same.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Narrative:</strong> A horror experience that digs into the drama of addiction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings:</strong> Your playstyle will decide Lisa\u2019s fate.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Authorial Design:</strong> Crafted with the aesthetic vision of a professional designer.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>YOU HAVE LOST EVERYTHING. ARE YOU READY TO PLAY YOUR LAST CHANCE?</strong></p>","developers":["Daniele Doesn't Matter"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indi